    description: '锐化特征线，增加精确的分件、倒角与功能细节。',
    directive: 'Secondary Features & Detailing: Refine all primary feature lines. Add precise parting lines (shut lines), functional buttons, or vents. Apply Variable Section Chamfers to all edges to ensure sophisticated light-to-shadow transitions.'
